# Files that have no business inside a packaged chart.
#
# helm package copies everything that is not listed here, so a stray values file
# holding real credentials would end up in the .tgz and in a chart repository.

.git/
.gitignore
.github/

# Credential material. tls.key is the one that matters most: a private key in a
# chart is readable by anyone who can pull the chart.
*.key
*.crt
*.pem
tls.key
tls.crt
crm-secrets*
values.local.yaml
values.*.local.yaml

# Operator notes. Not secrets, but not part of the application either.
README.md
docs/
